# Written 2026-11-25 beside the coordinator's defect draft
# d-lane-layer-speed-2 (lane linux-ci): a program for each family of the
# platform layer's members, built and run at every level on every leg, since a
# member calling a name the link does not carry (libm's `nextafter` and `sin`
# in the UI and audio families) is refused only on the leg that lacks it, at
# -O0 and -O2 and never under --sanitize. This family linked in the Linux
# arm64 image before the repair; the case holds it.
extern "hero_net.h" layer
    function hero_net_last_error() -> i64

function main()
    print(f"net: {hero_net_last_error()}")
